/* Ties the abstract a2,a1,a0 lemmas to the REAL physical parameters: the discriminant
 * a1^2-4*a2*a0 with the real coefficients equals the explicit fold polynomial
 * disc(wn,Vg,Rg,Lg,Cf,idr).  So {disc=0} above IS the real sweep.py voltage-collapse
 * surface, not a classical-pendulum stand-in.  (iqr=0 as in sweep.py.) */
